.SH NAME
mitsubishi\-echonet\-discover \- multicast discovery of ECHONET Lite devices
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B mitsubishi\-echonet discover [\-\-timeout SECONDS]
.SH DESCRIPTION
.PP
Sends a multicast discovery and prints every ECHONET Lite device that answers within the timeout. Exits 1 when no device answers.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
.B \-\-timeout SECONDS
seconds to listen (default: 3)
.SH EXAMPLES
.PP
mitsubishi\-echonet discover
.RS
Discover ECHONET Lite devices on the local network.
.RE
